			subtitle: "Refined energistics?"
			description: [
				"Hello again! This quest line will tell you about another storage option."
				""
				"First of all. There is a questline dedicated for applied energistics. Dont want RS? Go read that instead"
				""
				"When we separated ae2 lovers, we can truly begin"
				"What is Refined Storage? RS is a storage network that can store all of your items, think about it as VERY large chest. It can auto craft things on demand. In this chapter I will show you how to setup basic system and basic autocrafts"
